  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faq-layout">
        <div class="faq-heading">
          <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list" data-faq-list>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">
            What is Facility Intelligence?
            <svg class="chevron" width="12" height="7" viewBox="0 0 12 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 1l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-1" hidden>
             Buying decisions for technically complex solutions like Material handling or warehouse automation rarely originate in the board room. They show up as problems on the warehousing floor much earlier and leave digital breadcrumbs. Automatisor does a deep research on each facility to uncover these breadcrumbs and convert them into insights about its operations, labor, inventory, infrastructure, financial & regulatory aspects. It gathers 200+ unique insights at a facility level from 20+ pre-vetted and validated data sources. It also periodically refreshes it to ensure the right, recent and relevant ground truth is available to you.          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">
            What is an Ideal Facility Profile?
            <svg class="chevron" width="12" height="7" viewBox="0 0 12 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 1l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
